        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Damn, another one fell in...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чорт, ще один впав...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Don't touch anything, please.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не чіпайте нічого, будь ласка.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Yup, looks like an accident to me.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Так, схоже на нещасний випадок.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Phew... it's so hot in here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Фух... тут так спекотно.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Poor guy. Burning in molten metal must be... painful.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Бідний хлопець. Горіти в розплавленому металі має бути... болісно.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>He used to be a heavy drinker. Maybe he lost his balance and fell over the railing? ::Shrugs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Він колись любив випити. Можливо, він втратив рівновагу і впав за поручні? ::Пожимає плечима.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
